a: {
color: 'red',
lineHeight: 10
},
b: {
backgroundColor: {
image: 'xxx/xxx.jpg'
},
height: 40
},
x: {
fontSize: 18,
fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei',
borderColor: '#449933',
borderRadius: 4
},
...
}
}

```

For more details, see Rich Text please.

